# Downloaded GM guitar soundfont packs (~50 MB total). Fetched by
# Download-Soundfonts.ps1 or automatically by Build-Installer.ps1. Not
# checked in because they bloat the repo and can be re-downloaded on
# demand. The public/soundfonts/README.txt file IS committed (see the
# negation below) so the folder always exists.
